msgctxt "L1"
msgid "# Container image for the event-driven Node.js entry. Run it with: sandbox/container/run-image.sh src/javascript-events"
msgstr "# Imagen de contenedor para la entrada de Node.js dirigida por eventos. Ejecútala con: sandbox/container/run-image.sh src/javascript-events"

msgctxt "L2"
msgid "# The whole program is one file, timecards.mjs, run by Node 24 (node:sqlite and node:events are built in; there is no npm and no package)."
msgstr "# Todo el programa es un solo archivo, timecards.mjs, ejecutado por Node 24 (node:sqlite y node:events vienen incluidos; no hay npm ni paquetes)."

msgctxt "L3"
msgid "# Add --tty to the run-image.sh command to see the DEMO ONLY line pulse. check.sh and check.mjs are for your own machine."
msgstr "# Añade --tty al comando run-image.sh para ver pulsar la línea DEMO ONLY. check.sh y check.mjs son para tu propia máquina."
